OL,3,GNEWSADerbyshire Tour de France Femmes
OL,4,Aroute revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of Derbyshire's most challenging
OL,7,Froads and recognisable landscapes will
OL,8,Ffeature on the route of the Tour de
OL,9,FFrance Femmes when the race comes to
OL,10,Fthe UK for the first time in 2027.
OL,12,FOrganisers have confirmed Stage 2 of
OL,13,Fthe race will pass through the Peak
OL,14,FDistrict on 31 July as riders travel
OL,15,Ffrom Manchester to Sheffield.
OL,17,FThe 154.4km (95.9-mile) stage includes
OL,18,Falmost 3,000m (9,843ft) of climbing and
OL,19,Fwill take competitors over both Winnats
OL,20,FPass and Snake Pass.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
